<title>JAPAN: BOJ Matsushita to meet NYK Fed President McDonough.</title>
<headline>BOJ Matsushita to meet NYK Fed President McDonough.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will meet New York Fed President William McDonough in Tokyo on Wednesday, a BOJ spokesman said.</p>
<p>The planned meeting is aimed at a regular exchange of information between the two banks, he added.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
</text>
